Create Fly: Bits n Bobs (Unofficial Port)
=========================================

This is an unofficial port of Create: Bits 'n' Bobs to Fabric for Minecraft 26.2,
built against Create Fly (ZurrTum's Fabric build of Create). It is not made,
endorsed or supported by the upstream authors.

Upstream project
----------------
Create: Bits 'n' Bobs by Cake, Kipti, NormalGuy, Astral and Spydnel (AzTech Modding).
Source: https://github.com/Aztech-Modding/Create-Bits-n-Bobs
Ported from commit 4c71fe279a50351d519fa4c44e0a9cf157e6057e (version 2.3.2).
Modrinth: https://modrinth.com/mod/create-bits-n-bobs

Licence
-------
Upstream declares the MIT License in its mod metadata (`neoforge.mods.toml`,
expanded from `mod_license=MIT` in `gradle.properties`) and on its Modrinth page.
Upstream ships no LICENSE file and no copyright line, so the MIT text and the
copyright line in the LICENSE file beside this notice were CONSTRUCTED for this
distribution from the declared grant and the authors listed in
`gradle.properties`; they were not preserved from upstream, because upstream
wrote none to preserve.

Assets and data
---------------
All textures, models, sounds and datapack files are upstream's, redistributed
under the same declared MIT grant. Upstream's `vault/` directory of loose source
art is not part of this port.

Port-specific code
------------------
The registration layer under `com.kipti.bnb.registrate`, the behaviour layer
under `com.kipti.bnb.foundation.behaviour`, the Sable Companion stand-ins under
`com.kipti.bnb.compat.sable` and the networking layer under
`com.kipti.bnb.network` were written for this port and are released under the
same MIT terms.
